# Layout ladder, step 4 (plan/20-core-domain/29-layout-ladder.md): a valve on the return. The valve
# states its Kv: on a bare loop with nothing to throttle against, a sized Kv stalls the solve (C-66).

fluidscript 1
circuit ladder
fluid water

PU1  pump
HE1  heat_exchanger power=30 in=20 out=50
LOAD heat_exchanger power=-30
CV1  valve kv=6.3

connections
PU1 - HE1
HE1 - LOAD
LOAD - CV1
CV1 - PU1
